Subject: [PATCH] systeminfo, tasklist, net: switches and formats (3523)

systeminfo, tasklist, net: switches and formats

systeminfo takes /FO table|list|csv and /NH and prints the Virtual Memory: In Use line. tasklist gets
/V (status, user name, CPU time, window title), /SVC (the services in each process) and the matching
filters. net gets HELPMSG and SHARE (listing; making or removing a share still needs the account and
share design).
